{
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "problem",
      "line_id": "pr-1",
      "filename": "problem-pr-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/problem-pr-1.mp3",
      "duration": 5.08,
      "size": 81216,
      "text": "这个项目里已经有一整套解方程组的课：LU 分解、QR 分解、Cholesky、最小二乘。它们讲的都是怎么算。这门课讲的是另一件事：什么时候算不准。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "problem",
      "line_id": "pr-2",
      "filename": "problem-pr-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/problem-pr-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.53,
      "size": 72432,
      "text": "设想你要解一个方程组 A x 等于 b。右端项 b 通常来自测量，总带一点误差；就算不带，存进计算机也会有舍入误差。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "problem",
      "line_id": "pr-3",
      "filename": "problem-pr-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/problem-pr-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.99,
      "size": 79776,
      "text": "问题是：b 差了万分之一，解出来的 x 会差多少？直觉上也该差万分之一左右。但事实是，有些矩阵会把这个误差放大成千上万倍。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "problem",
      "line_id": "pr-4",
      "filename": "problem-pr-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/problem-pr-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.71,
      "size": 59328,
      "text": "放大多少倍，由一个数决定，叫条件数，记作 κ。这门课就讲它是什么、为什么、以及怎么一眼看出来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "geometry",
      "line_id": "ge-1",
      "filename": "geometry-ge-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/geometry-ge-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.51,
      "size": 56160,
      "text": "先看几何。取所有长度为一的向量，它们组成一个单位球面。让矩阵 A 作用上去，球会变成什么？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "geometry",
      "line_id": "ge-2",
      "filename": "geometry-ge-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/geometry-ge-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59616,
      "text": "答案是一个椭球。这一点 SVD 那课已经讲过二维的版本：圆变椭圆。三维也一样，球变椭球。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "geometry",
      "line_id": "ge-3",
      "filename": "geometry-ge-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/geometry-ge-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.65,
      "size": 58320,
      "text": "而且椭球的三条半轴长度，恰好就是 A 的三个奇异值。画面右边那三根箭头标的就是它们。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "geometry",
      "line_id": "ge-4",
      "filename": "geometry-ge-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/geometry-ge-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.62,
      "size": 57888,
      "text": "现在关键的一步：条件数就是最长半轴除以最短半轴。换句话说，κ 就是这个椭球有多扁。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "geometry",
      "line_id": "ge-5",
      "filename": "geometry-ge-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/geometry-ge-5.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55296,
      "text": "注意画面两侧用的是同一个缩放，不是各画各的。这样才看得出椭球相对于球被拉长和压扁了多少。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-1",
      "filename": "why-wh-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/why-wh-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.57,
      "size": 73152,
      "text": "球是各向同性的：往哪个方向偏一点，效果都一样。椭球不是。沿着长轴，A 把向量拉长；沿着短轴，A 把向量压扁。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-2",
      "filename": "why-wh-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/why-wh-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.83,
      "size": 61344,
      "text": "被压扁意味着什么？意味着那个方向上的信息几乎被抹平了。原来相差很多的两个向量，映过去之后几乎重合。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-3",
      "filename": "why-wh-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/why-wh-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.96,
      "size": 79344,
      "text": "解方程是反着走：从 b 找 x。压扁的那一步要反过来撑开，误差也就跟着被撑开。撑开的倍数，最大正是最长与最短之比 —— 也就是 κ。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-4",
      "filename": "why-wh-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/why-wh-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.41,
      "size": 54576,
      "text": "写成不等式就是：解的相对误差，不超过 κ 乘以右端项的相对误差。κ 是一个上界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-5",
      "filename": "why-wh-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/why-wh-5.mp3",
      "duration": 7.43,
      "size": 118944,
      "text": "而且这个上界是能取到的。画面左边那根粉色箭头标的就是最坏方向。实测：κ 等于一千九百九十九的那个矩阵，沿最坏方向扰动，放大倍数正好是一千九百九十九；换随机方向只有一千五百五十二，够不到上界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "det",
      "line_id": "de-1",
      "filename": "det-de-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/det-de-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.14,
      "size": 50256,
      "text": "很多人以为，行列式接近零就说明矩阵病态。这个说法是错的，而且错得很彻底。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "det",
      "line_id": "de-2",
      "filename": "det-de-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/det-de-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "切到「整体缩小一千倍」那个预设。这个矩阵是单位阵乘以千分之一，行列式是十的负九次方，非常小。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "det",
      "line_id": "de-3",
      "filename": "det-de-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/det-de-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.05,
      "size": 64800,
      "text": "但看条件数：正好等于一。完美良态。球映过去还是球，只是小了一千倍，没有任何方向被相对压扁。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "det",
      "line_id": "de-4",
      "filename": "det-de-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/det-de-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.95,
      "size": 63216,
      "text": "反过来看「斜切」那个预设，行列式恰好等于一，条件数却接近六。行列式完全正常，矩阵却已经不那么好了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "det",
      "line_id": "de-5",
      "filename": "det-de-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/det-de-5.mp3",
      "duration": 6.07,
      "size": 97056,
      "text": "道理很简单：行列式是三个奇异值的乘积，而条件数是最大与最小的比值。一个是积，一个是比，两者可以任意组合。整体缩放会改变行列式，但完全不改变条件数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "practice",
      "line_id": "pa-1",
      "filename": "practice-pa-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/practice-pa-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.52,
      "size": 72288,
      "text": "有一条很好用的经验法则。双精度浮点数大约有十六位有效数字。条件数如果是十的 k 次方，那么解里大约会丢掉 k 位有效数字。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "practice",
      "line_id": "pa-2",
      "filename": "practice-pa-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/practice-pa-2.mp3",
      "duration": 6.78,
      "size": 108432,
      "text": "所以 κ 等于一千，丢三位，还剩十三位，通常无所谓。κ 等于十的八次方，单精度就全废了，双精度还剩八位。κ 要是到了十的十六次方，一位都不剩，算出来的东西完全不能信。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "practice",
      "line_id": "pa-3",
      "filename": "practice-pa-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/practice-pa-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.93,
      "size": 94896,
      "text": "最有名的病态例子是希尔伯特矩阵，第 i 行第 j 列是 i 加 j 减一分之一。它看起来平平无奇，条件数却爆炸式增长：六阶已经超过十的七次方，十阶超过十的十三次方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "practice",
      "line_id": "pa-4",
      "filename": "practice-pa-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/practice-pa-4.mp3",
      "duration": 7.75,
      "size": 123984,
      "text": "遇到病态怎么办？三条路：一是换更稳的算法，比如用 QR 而不是正规方程解最小二乘，因为正规方程会把条件数平方；二是做预条件，把问题变形成良态的；三是承认信息本来就不够，改用正则化，接受一个有偏但稳定的解。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "practice",
      "line_id": "pa-5",
      "filename": "practice-pa-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/practice-pa-5.mp3",
      "duration": 7.25,
      "size": 115920,
      "text": "顺带说一句，本课自己算奇异值时也踩了同一个坑：先算 A 转置乘 A 再取特征值，这一步会把条件数平方。这里只需要量级所以够用，但要高精度就得直接对 A 做单边 Jacobi。讲数值稳定的课，自己也得守规矩。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.12,
      "size": 49968,
      "text": "条件数 κ 等于最大奇异值比最小奇异值，几何上就是「A 把单位球映成的椭球有多扁」。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.2,
      "size": 67248,
      "text": "它是误差放大倍数的上界，并且在最坏方向上正好取到。经验法则：κ 等于十的 k 次方，就丢掉 k 位有效数字。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "size": 63072,
      "text": "别拿行列式判断病态。行列式是奇异值之积，条件数是最大与最小之比 —— 缩放会改变前者，却完全不影响后者。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "condition-number",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-4",
      "filename": "summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/condition-number/yunxi/summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.0,
      "size": 15984,
      "text": "继续探索数学之美！"
    }
  ],
